*.json text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.rs text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
# Generated SDK sources (tau-sdk-codegen) are byte-compared against a fresh
# LF render by tests/drift.rs; pin them to LF so a Windows checkout with
# core.autocrlf=true does not introduce CRLF drift. See #530.
*.py text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
# Committed golden files byte-compared against LF-rendered output on the
# Windows Tier-2 job (surfaced by the #550 full-matrix run):
#   - crates/tau-wasm-guest/wit-baseline/runner.wit vs generate_world(&[])
#     (tau-wasm-guest tests/wit_world.rs::baseline_equals_empty_generate_world)
#   - sdk/embed-js/.gitignore vs render_embed_js() (the only embed-js scaffold
#     file whose extension was not already pinned above)
#     (tau-sdk-codegen tests/embed_js_drift.rs::committed_embed_js_matches_fresh_render)
*.wit text eol=lf
.gitignore text eol=lf
